"""CHIM ORomance Bridge - MCM menu and its translations.

Writes mcm/config.json (MCM Helper menu; every visible text is a "$COR_..." key) from the
MENU layout below, and mcm/translations/CHIMORomanceBridge_<LANGUAGE>.txt (UTF-16 LE + BOM,
"$key<TAB>text" lines, CRLF - the format SkyUI expects). The game picks the file matching
its language (sLanguage in Skyrim.ini). SkyUI has no fallback, so languages without a
translation get a copy of English. Run: python3 -I localize.py
"""
